<title>USA: Bergen Brunswig Q4 Sept 30 net higher.</title>
<headline>Bergen Brunswig Q4 Sept 30 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>ORANGE, Calif. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>BERGEN BRUNSWIG CORPORATION</p>
<p>		   Summary of Consolidated Sales and Earnings</p>
<p>(in thousands except share and per share amounts)</p>
<p>			 Fourth Quarter Ended  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>			  September 30,	   September 30,</p>
<p>			    1996	 1995	  1996	 1995</p>
